{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Manual Ledger Review",
  "description": "Comprehensive review and cleanup of the development ledger for accuracy and completeness",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered",
    "label": "📋 Review & Update Development Ledger"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Perform a comprehensive review and update of the development ledger:\n\n🔍 **Comprehensive Ledger Audit**\n\n1. **Status Verification**\n   - Cross-reference tasks.md with ledger status\n   - Verify completed tasks match actual implementation\n   - Identify any missing or outdated task entries\n   - Check for tasks marked complete but not implemented\n\n2. **Architecture Documentation Review**\n   - Ensure technical decisions are properly documented\n   - Verify technology stack information is current\n   - Check that security implementations are recorded\n   - Update any changed architectural patterns\n\n3. **File Structure Audit**\n   - Compare documented file structure with actual codebase\n   - Update component organization documentation\n   - Record any new directories or major file moves\n   - Verify service layer organization matches documentation\n\n4. **Implementation Details Check**\n   - Ensure all major implementations have proper documentation\n   - Check that Firebase configuration details are current\n   - Verify testing strategy matches actual test setup\n   - Update environment and setup instructions\n\n5. **Developer Handoff Validation**\n   - Test that setup instructions are complete and accurate\n   - Verify knowledge transfer checklist covers all critical areas\n   - Ensure all dependencies and prerequisites are listed\n   - Check that troubleshooting information is current\n\n📊 **Quality Assurance Checklist**\n\n- [ ] All task statuses accurately reflect implementation\n- [ ] Technical decisions have proper documentation\n- [ ] File structure matches actual codebase\n- [ ] Setup instructions are complete and tested\n- [ ] Known issues and workarounds are documented\n- [ ] Change log is chronological and complete\n- [ ] Formatting is consistent throughout\n- [ ] All manual entries are preserved\n\n🔧 **Cleanup Tasks**\n\n- Remove any duplicate or outdated entries\n- Standardize formatting and terminology\n- Ensure proper markdown structure\n- Update dates to YYYY-MM-DD format\n- Verify all file paths are accurate\n\n📝 **Output Requirements**\n\nProvide a comprehensive updated ledger that:\n- Accurately reflects current project state\n- Maintains all valuable historical information\n- Follows the established maintenance standards\n- Enables seamless developer handoffs\n- Documents any discrepancies found and resolved\n\nInclude a summary of changes made and any issues discovered during the review.\n\n**Context Sources to Reference:**\n- #[[file:.kiro/ledger/development-log.md]]\n- #[[file:.kiro/specs/client-dashboard-portal/tasks.md]]\n- #[[file:.kiro/steering/structure.md]]\n- **Chat History**: Review all previous conversations for missing context\n- **Development Sessions**: Include insights from past developer interactions\n- **Decision History**: Reference previous discussions that led to current state"
  }
}